# FamilyOS parent-auth PAM service.
#
# Used by parental-tools/lib/require-parent-auth.sh (via `pamtester`) to
# verify the `parent` account's password from scripts that are already
# running as root (post-sudo). Deliberately its own service rather than
# reusing `login` or `common-auth`, which carry unrelated tty/session
# checks that don't apply here.
#
# NOT YET VALIDATED against a real Devuan target - see
# parental-tools/README.md "Known open items."

auth    required    pam_unix.so
account required    pam_unix.so
